cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Glasshouse — institutional accountability evidence dataset (say vs. do)"
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  A public-interest dataset joining what major financial institutions publicly
  commit to (archived proxy-voting / stewardship policies) with what they
  actually do (SEC N-PX proxy votes, 13-F / N-PORT holdings) and the public
  enforcement record. Primary-source-cited, de-duplicated, and self-describing;
  built for researchers and journalists to find and verify insights. Findings
  are human-gated and the data ships as facts, not accusations.
authors:
  - name: "Glasshouse"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - proxy voting
  - SEC N-PX
  - asset managers
  - corporate governance
  - stewardship
  - shareholder voting
  - ESG accountability
  - financial transparency
